   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF MOLDOVA IRL 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the Better Care programme, UNICEF and the Ministry of Labour and Social Protection of Moldova seek to fully realise the 2022&#x2013;2026 National Programme for Child Protection. Moldova&#x2019;s Better Care is designed to support all children in vulnerable situations, including Ukrainian refugee children who have fled the war. The Programme aligns with reforms necessary for accession and complements humanitarian funding in response to the impact of the war in Ukraine on Moldova.</narrative>
  </description>
